<title>UZBEKISTAN: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT INDONESIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT INDONESIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan beat Indonesia 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group five</p>
<p>qualifier played late on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Oleg Shatskikh 11, Shukhrat Maksudov 36, 84.</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p> Uzbekistan		  4   3   1   0  11   1  10</p>
<p> Yemen			 5   2   2   1   9   2   8</p>
<p> Indonesia		   6   1   4   1  11   6   7</p>
<p> Cambodia		    5   0   1   4   1  23   1</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 29 Cambodia v Uzbekistan, July 13</p>
<p>Uzbekistan v Yemen</p>
</text>
